        <li><span>03</span><strong>{t('结果仍然打转，于是回到接口语义', 'The loop remained, so we moved back to action-interface semantics')}</strong><p>{t('步数不是主要解释；后续继续检查 prompt、deliberation 和 action channel，但不能把这一步说成已经解决最终低分。', 'Horizon is not the main explanation; later work investigates prompt, deliberation, and the action channel, but this step does not solve the final low score.')}</p></li>
