      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('我们先把文本记忆模块一次生成能用的 token 上限从', 'We first increased the Text Memory generation token cap from')} <strong>2048 → 4096</strong>{t('，仍然饱和。最后我们停止继续堆容量，改成有边界的分块处理：同一批 20 条记录修复一次后若仍饱和，才固定拆成 10 + 10，分别压缩再合并。', '. It still saturated. We stopped adding more capacity and switched to bounded decomposition: if the same 20 records still saturate after one repair pass, split them deterministically into 10 + 10, compress each half, then merge them.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>{t('单次容量实验', 'single-call capacity')}</span><strong>2048 → 4096</strong><p>{t('单纯把 token 上限翻倍仍然没有解决容量失败。', 'Doubling the token cap alone did not resolve the capacity failure.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>{t('结构化处理', 'structured recovery')}</span><strong>20 {t('条记录', 'records')} → 10 + 10</strong><p>{t('先保留原来的 20 条记录；如果同一批记录修复一次后仍然饱和，才固定拆成前 10 + 后 10，分别压缩后再合并。', 'Keep the original 20 records first; only if the same records still saturate after one repair pass do we split into first 10 + last 10, compress each half, then merge.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="resolution-box"><strong>{t('最终怎么解决容量饱和', 'How we ultimately handled saturation')}</strong><p>{t('最终处理方式是：先处理全部 20 条原始记录；如果达到容量上限，就用同 20 条、同样顺序再修复一次；如果仍然饱和，才固定拆成前 10 + 后 10，分别压缩后再合并。这样把“容量一满就卡死”变成一个有边界、可复现的恢复路径；但它只解决容量故障，不等于证明最终 WebShop 分数因此提高。', 'The final procedure is: process all 20 original records; if the output reaches the capacity limit, repair the same 20 in the same order once; only if it still saturates do we split deterministically into first 10 + last 10, compress each half, and merge them. This turns saturation from a blocking failure into a bounded, reproducible recovery path; it does not by itself prove a higher final WebShop score.')}</p></div>
